  {"key": "margins", "title": "Margins and costs", "sentences": [
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Operating margin of 46.8% is the window high, 5.1pp above the 41.7% median and 16.7pp above the FY2017 low [F50][D974][D975][D973]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Gross margin slipped 0.9pp to 67.9%, below the 68.2% median, as cost of revenue rose 21.1% and took 0.9pp off operating margin [F30][D486][D981][D489][D500]."},
    {"type": "cause", "text": "Intelligent Cloud gross margin percentage fell on continued AI infrastructure investment and mix shift to Azure, partly offset by Azure efficiency gains [P11]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "R&D fell to 10.7% of revenue, the window low, and added 0.8pp to margin as operating expenses grew 7.4% [D450][D985][D501][D491]."},
    {"type": "cause", "text": "Net margin of 40.3% exceeded operating margin by 6.5pp below the line, helped by $6.5 billion of OpenAI investment gains in other income [F70][F50][D1023][P7]."}
  ]},
  {"key": "cash", "title": "Cash conversion", "sentences": [
    {"type": "fact", "text": "Operating cash flow rose 34.4% to $182.9 billion, 55.1% of revenue, on higher customer cash receipts and lower tax payments [F100][D477][D457][P1]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Free cash flow fell 6.5% to $67.0 billion, a 20.2% margin and the window low, as capex rose 79.6% to $115.9 billion [F120][D478][D456][D982][F110][D479]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Free cash flow covered only 0.50x of net income, the window low against a 0.91x median, and capex ran 3.38x D&A [D460][D988][D990][D461]."},
    {"type": "cause", "text": "Investing cash use rose $66.9 billion, mainly a $51.4 billion increase in property and equipment additions and $22.2 billion for component purchases [P1]."}
  ]},
