    {"type": "fact", "text": "Buybacks of $22.3 billion plus dividends of $26.4 billion used 72.7% of free cash flow [X147][X157][D468]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Return on average equity of 34.0% sits at the peer median of 38.8%, below the FY2022 peak of 47.2% [D471][D1011][D257]."}
